                                <div class="absolute -top-3 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 bg-green-500 text-white text-xs font-bold py-1 px-3 uppercase">Beliebt</div>
                                <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-green-50  flex items-center justify-center text-3xl mx-auto mb-6">🚗🏍️</div>
                                <h4 class="font-bold text-xl mb-3 text-gray-900">Kombi B + A</h4>
